<?php $pageTitle='Replacement requests';$counts=['all'=>count($requests),'pending'=>0,'approved'=>0,'rejected'=>0];foreach($requests as $item)if(isset($counts[$item['status']]))$counts[$item['status']]++; ?>
<div class="ops-page replacements-page ops-enter"><section class="replacement-heading"><div><a href="<?= e(url('invigilation')) ?>"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Invigilation duties</a><div class="ops-brand"><img src="<?= e(url('assets/images/gbu-emblem.png')) ?>" alt="" width="45" height="45"><span>Gautam Buddha University<br><b>Examination Cell</b></span></div><h1>Replacement management</h1><p>Request, review, and retain every faculty-duty change in the operational record.</p></div><div class="replacement-count"><span class="ops-icon icon-swap" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong><?= $counts['pending'] ?></strong><small>requests awaiting review</small></div></section><?php if($success):?><div class="alert success" role="status"><?= e($success) ?></div><?php endif;?>
<div class="replacement-workspace"><form class="replacement-form" method="post" action="<?= e(url('replacements')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><header><span class="ops-icon icon-swap" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><h2>Request a replacement</h2><p>Select an assigned duty and record the reason.</p></div></header><label>Assigned duty<select name="duty_id" required><option value="">Select a faculty duty</option><?php foreach($duties as $d):?><option value="<?= (int)$d['id'] ?>"><?= e(date('d M',strtotime($d['exam_date'])).' | '.$d['shift_name'].' | '.$d['room_code'].' - '.$d['faculty_name']) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Suggested faculty<select name="replacement_faculty_id"><option value="">No suggestion</option><?php foreach($faculty as $f):?><option value="<?= (int)$f['id'] ?>"><?= e($f['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><small>The reviewer can approve the suggested faculty member.</small></label><label>Reason<textarea name="reason" rows="4" placeholder="State the operational reason for this change" required></textarea></label><button <?= !$duties?'disabled':'' ?>><span>Submit request</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></button><?php if(!$duties):?><p class="form-empty-note">No active assigned duties are available for replacement.</p><?php endif;?></form>
<section class="replacement-register"><header><div><h2>Request register</h2><p>Filter and review the recorded changes.</p></div><div class="replacement-filters"><button class="active" type="button" data-replacement-filter="all">All <span><?= $counts['all'] ?></span></button><button type="button" data-replacement-filter="pending">Pending <span><?= $counts['pending'] ?></span></button><button type="button" data-replacement-filter="approved">Approved <span><?= $counts['approved'] ?></span></button><button type="button" data-replacement-filter="rejected">Rejected <span><?= $counts['rejected'] ?></span></button></div></header><?php if($requests):?><div class="replacement-list" aria-live="polite"><?php foreach($requests as $i=>$r):?><article data-replacement-status="<?= e($r['status']) ?>" style="--ops-order:<?= $i ?>"><div class="replacement-session"><span><?= e(date('d M Y',strtotime($r['exam_date']))) ?></span><strong><?= e($r['shift_name']) ?></strong><small>Room <?= e($r['room_code']) ?></small></div><div class="replacement-people"><div><span>Original faculty</span><strong><?= e($r['original_name']) ?></strong></div><span class="ops-icon icon-swap" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><span>Suggested replacement</span><strong><?= e($r['replacement_name']??'Not selected') ?></strong></div></div><p><?= e($r['reason']) ?></p><div class="replacement-review"><span class="ops-status <?= e($r['status']) ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($r['status'])) ?></span><?php if($r['status']==='pending'):?><div><form method="post" action="<?= e(url('replacements/'.$r['id'].'/approve')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><button class="approve"><span class="ops-icon icon-check" aria-hidden="true"></span>Approve</button></form><form method="post" action="<?= e(url('replacements/'.$r['id'].'/reject')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><button class="reject">Reject</button></form></div><?php endif;?></div></article><?php endforeach;?><div class="ops-filter-empty" hidden><strong>No requests in this status</strong><span>Choose another filter to continue.</span></div></div><?php else:?><div class="ops-empty compact"><span class="ops-icon icon-swap" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>No replacement requests</h2><p>Submitted requests will appear here for review.</p></div><?php endif;?></section></div></div>
<script>(()=>{const buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-replacement-filter]')],rows=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-replacement-status]')],empty=document.querySelector('.ops-filter-empty');buttons.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{buttons.forEach(item=>item.classList.toggle('active',item===button));let shown=0;rows.forEach(row=>{const visible=button.dataset.replacementFilter==='all'||row.dataset.replacementStatus===button.dataset.replacementFilter;row.hidden=!visible;if(visible)shown++;});if(empty)empty.hidden=shown!==0;}));})();</script>
